# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  TypeCraft-inspired powerline prompt  (Catppuccin Mocha · Nerd Fonts required)
#
#  Switch to this prompt:   prompt-tc [scheme]   (prompt-tc -h lists schemes)
#  Switch back to default:  prompt-sd [scheme]
