#  catppuccin, monokai-pro, tokyonight, material, kanagawa, cyberdream —
#  `prompt-tc -h` lists them with one-line descriptions.
#  prompt-tc is a FUNCTION (defined at the bottom) so it can take the scheme
#  argument — the .bash_aliases entry was removed in its favor.
#
#  Visual structure — two lines: identity, then time + git state. Each line is
